{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行超大标题首先入眼：红色“不再藏着喜欢”，接着是金色“连害臊都顾不上了”。字号、亮度和位置都明显占优，右侧目录和下方音符动画是次要视觉信息。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"此刻不再隐藏自己对一个人的喜欢，甚至顾不上害羞了。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"热烈、心动、大胆，带着顾不上羞怯的冲动。\",\n  \"missed\": \"正文中期待终于得到满足但事情还没有结束的处境，以及夕阳般刺眼、想流泪、胸口发痛的复杂感受。右侧目录中的前几个阶段也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"正文两行较长，包含期待得到满足、事情尚未结束以及视觉和身体感受等多层信息，细节需要进一步阅读。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 4\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6ce1b4ce-d4eb-41ab-b882-2c9202799ae2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T020700452896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:07:38.979723+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f0b1393d087de2366d23883919c396901e6e24250475a813e918eb422734686", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850000